  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "國際貿易理論與政策",
    "sub_ename": "THEORY AND POLICY OF INTERNATIONAL TRADE",
    "describe_ch": "理論部份強調參與貿易者可互蒙其利，介紹李嘉圖之比較利益原理、赫克夏一歐林模型、及在不完全競爭市場之下的貿易模型。貿易政策部份在分析各種不同之貿易政策如關稅、配額等的經濟效果，並分析在不同經濟發展階段應該強調的貿易政策。",
    "describe_eh": " In theory, this course emphasizes gains from trade and introduce the Ricardo's principle of comparative advantage, H-O model, and the trade model under the imperfect competition. In policy, we analyze variant trade policies, such as tariff, quota, etc., and their economic effects, and emphasize that different policies can be adopted according to the stage of economic development.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "能理解古典貿易理論及新貿易理論",
      "describe_en": "Comprehension for the classical trade theory and the new trade theory"
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "能分析各種國際貿易政策之效果",
      "describe_en": "To analyze the effects of different international trade policies"
    }
  ],
